      "content": "Thanks for that. The part about the bedrock and reinforcement sounds reassuring. I did see a section in the geological report about seismic activity and something about soil composition during tremors—it mentioned 'liquefaction' in passing. Can you take a closer look at that specific part of the data? I need to know if that's a real deal-breaker for the structural integrity of these high-rises or if it's just something we can manage with the right engineering.",
